    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="13.09.008"></a>Division 13-09-008<br />Micro-Trenching</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1309008.html#13.09.008.0001">13-09-008-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Micro-Trench Fiber-Optic Cable Installation</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1309008.html#13.09.008.0002">13-09-008-0002</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Planning</p>

